This utility could be a wrapper of `sendRedirect`:

```ts
function sendRedirectBack(event) {
  const back = getHeader(event, 'referer') || '/'
  return sendRedirect(event, back)
}
```

This type of utility is in many framework:

https://expressjs.com/en/4x/api.html#res.redirect
https://docs.adonisjs.com/guides/response#redirect-back-to-the-previous-page
